{"id": "61316", "title": "老师太诱爱", "author": "熊猫猫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61316.htm", "intro": "“我最讨厌数学了！”\r\n\r\n“那你讨厌我吗？”\r\n\r\n“呃……不至於啦，我讨厌的只是数学，而不是教数学的你……”\r\n\r\n“是吗……不讨厌我啊……”\r\n\r\n他说罢，猝不及一个炙热火辣的吻就堵了上来，严密地封住我的唇……\r\n\r\n属性分类：现代／校园故事／未定／轻松", "base": "files/article/html/61/61316", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "9030058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "9030063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "9030065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "9030072.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "9030075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "9030077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "9030079.html", "available": false}]}